</p>
<p>The only thing we know for certain is that Major Perkins plays the tuba on Wednesdays. All the other seeming deductions (that Major Perkins is musical, not bleary-eyed, and not a golfer; that he does not try to shave with a toothbrush, and that he remembers to change his socks) require the assumption that Perkins is a man.</p>
